":["wuwen-q-c2f55f326342aebf012b"]}],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"dongyuan-m-p125-dongyuan-p0188","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["dongyuan-q-p125"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"dongyuan-q-p125","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-359c0d550c2e4b58c3fc","layer":"pei","quote":"先甥同郡周不疑，字元直，零陵人。《先贤传》称：“不疑幼有异才，聪明敏达；太祖欲以女妻之，不疑不敢当。太祖爱子仓舒，夙有才智，谓可与不疑为俦。及仓舒卒，太祖心忌不疑，欲除之。文帝谏以为不可，太祖曰：‘此人非汝所能驾御也。’乃遣刺客杀之。","attribution":"裴注叙述及《先贤传》","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":509,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-0ebae0c8750bf2131337","start":0,"end":117,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"fangji-q-8f19928eebc0713b89b9","section":"chapter-029","block":"b-e1d64438b9fefe3c3e7c","layer":"original","quote":"及后爱子仓舒病困〖15〗，太祖叹曰：“吾悔杀华佗！令此儿强死也","section_title":"方伎传第二十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0064.xhtml","index":93,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":98,"end":129,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-011bb6cb38971512e901","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-456709c15dd45753e139","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝三﹞《魏书》载策曰：“惟黄初二年八月丙午，皇帝曰：‘咨！尔邓哀侯冲：昔皇天钟美于尔躬，俾聪哲之才，成于弱年；当永享显祚，克成厥终。如何不禄，早世夭昏！朕承天序，享有四海，并建亲亲，以藩王室；惟尔不逮斯荣，且葬礼未备：追悼之怀，怆然攸伤！今迁葬于高陵，使使持节兼谒者仆射、郎中陈承，追赐号曰邓公，祠以太牢。魂而有灵，休兹宠荣。呜呼哀哉！’”","attribution":"裴注引《魏书》策命","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":37,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-08a1bd7f439bf9705bcc","start":0,"end":170,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-41c6da253a140ed3e680","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-cec613631592f2eed57d","layer":"original","quote":"为聘甄氏亡女与合葬；赠骑都尉印绶，","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":14,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":82,"end":99,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-52d24a60beda96ff33d7","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-8412805cfed59c125ce3","layer":"original","quote":"邓哀王冲，字仓舒。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":12,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":9,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-5a6b5c5bdd37fe20b201","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-489845357505d38c5d9f","layer":"original","quote":"太和五年，加冲号曰邓哀王。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":16,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":54,"end":67,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-93171958b03f98ee2527","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-cec613631592f2eed57d","layer":"original","quote":"太祖数对群臣称述，有欲传后意。年十三，建安十三年疾病。太祖亲为请命〖11〗；及亡，哀甚。文帝宽喻太祖，太祖曰：“此我之不幸，而汝曹之幸也〖12〗！”﹝二﹞言则流涕，","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":14,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":82,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-93520fbc0117d5c359ce","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-489845357505d38c5d9f","layer":"original","quote":"黄初二年，追赠谥冲曰邓哀侯；又追加号为公。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":16,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":21,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-c2f55f326342aebf012b","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-87027621c423a4f13bd6","layer":"original","quote":"武皇帝二十五男：卞皇后生文皇帝、任城威王彰、陈思王植、萧怀王熊；刘夫人生丰愍王昂、相殇王铄；环夫人生邓哀王冲、彭城王据、燕王宇；杜夫人生沛穆王林、中山恭王衮；秦夫人生济阳怀王玹、陈留恭王峻；尹夫人生范阳闵王矩；王昭仪生赵王幹；孙姬生临邑殇公子上、楚王彪、刚殇公子勤；李姬生谷城殇公子乘、郿戴公子整、灵殇公子京；周姬生樊安公均；刘姬生广宗殇公子棘；宋姬生东平灵王徽；赵姬生乐陵王茂。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":190,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-c8c4e61d27850a23e05b","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-064b80e40fb3ed55bc0a","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《魏书》曰：“冲每见当刑者，辄探睹其冤枉之情，而微理之。及勤劳之吏，以过误触罪；常为太祖陈说，宜宽宥之。辨察仁爱，与性俱生；容貌姿美，有殊于众：故特见宠异。”","attribution":"裴注引《魏书》","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":35,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c85f64cf2aed6326c5bc","start":0,"end":82,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-e47d033b9b269e5ac1cb","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-ad0248ea4e8e77f5a95b","layer":"original","quote":"时军国多事，用刑严重。太祖马鞍在库，而为鼠所啮；库吏惧必死，议欲面缚首罪，犹惧不免〖5〗。冲谓曰：“待三日中，然后自归〖6〗。”冲于是以刀穿单衣〖7〗，如鼠啮者；谬为失意〖8〗，貌有愁色。太祖问之，冲对曰：“世俗以为鼠啮衣者，其主不吉。今单衣见啮，是以忧戚。”太祖曰：“此妄言耳！无所苦也。”俄而库吏以啮鞍闻，太祖笑曰：“儿衣在侧〖9〗，尚啮；况鞍悬柱乎？”一无所问。冲仁爱识达，皆此类也。凡应罪戮，而为冲微所辨理〖10〗，赖以济宥者，前后数十。﹝一﹞","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":13,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":226,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-ea21a7938bafedc3df08","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-8412805cfed59c125ce3","layer":"original","quote":"冲曰：“置象大船之上，而刻其水痕所至；称物以载之〖3〗，则校可知矣〖4〗。”太祖大悦，即施行焉。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":12,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":66,"end":114,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-62d991f61513e07f2293","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-763d138adfb7e3bb0310","layer":"original","quote":"原女早亡；时太祖爱子仓舒亦没〖8〗，太祖欲求合葬。原辞曰：“合葬，非礼也！原之所以自容于明公，公之所以待原者，以能守训典而不易也〖9〗。若听明公之命，则是凡庸也；明公焉以为哉？”太祖乃止","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":315,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":8,"end":101,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
